# Ancient Vows (battlefield.ancient_vows, Monarch Linn: a BattlefieldMission, index 0, 30 minutes, six players, entry NPC
# SD_Entrance). A level 75 Warrior of San d'Oria with Ancient Vows current and its Status 2 (GMs), who came from Riverne -
# Site #B01: entryRequirement refuses (the previous zone is B01): no options. Back in from Riverne - Site #A01: the menu
# 32000; area 1 (option 1): entered. The three Mammet-19 Epsilon of area 1 spawn at the first tick; killed: allDeath sets
# WON; the win: battlefieldWin, 32001; finished: the mission's handler (Status 2, the win: complete, the char set down in
# South Gustaberg), the Tavnazian Traveler title, 1000 XP.
lists MonarchLinn/SD_Entrance/onTrigger MonarchLinn/onEventUpdate/32000 MonarchLinn/onEventFinish/32000 MonarchLinn/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=RiverneSiteB01 pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop AncientVows current
charvar Mission[6][248]Status 2
login
warp -39.1,-3.3,-537 MonarchLinn        # from B01
trigger SD_Entrance                     # refused
warp 0,0,0 RiverneSiteA01
warp -39.1,-3.3,-537 MonarchLinn        # from A01
trigger SD_Entrance                     # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                   # area 1: entered
finish                                  # in the arena
tick 2000                               # the Mammets spawn
kill MAMMET_19_EPSILON
kill MAMMET_19_EPSILON+1
kill MAMMET_19_EPSILON+2                # allDeath: WON; 32001
finish                                  # the mission completes
tick 11000
tick 10000
